WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:02.099
if a person's identity

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:04.409
depends on qualities that can crumble

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:12.149
He or she is in danger of despair for without a sense of self we are nothing, and the world is unmoved by our existence

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.910
if everything should fade...

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.760
...what will be left of me?

00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:23.489
We live in fear of this loss of self our existential crisis

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.550
I'm called Lucatiel

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:32.250
I come from Mirrah, a land of knights. My sword is always ready

00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:35.459
There is only one way up in Mirrah

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:39.299
Join the order and prove yourself in battle

00:00:40.329 --> 00:00:43.859
my family Had little fortune and no name

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:47.639
I had to carve out a piece of the world for myself

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.550
with two things:

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.570
my sword and my loyalty to my Lord

00:00:55.629 --> 00:00:58.769
I was raised to wield a sword from birth

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:00.840
Life was hard

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:07.799
But I never gave it a second thought. I had swift success on the battlefield and quickly attained

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.729
respectable stature

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.930
And then I...

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.930
and then I came here...to

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.890
Who are you?

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:28.299
We came to Drangleic seeking answers. Our flesh like many others of humanity is branded with the dark sign of the undead

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:34.779
while marked an undead's memory of their humanity will fade until only a hollow husk remains

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:40.180
Undeath robs us of our past and in doing so, it robs us of our fate

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:46.080
Luccatiel was marked and she bears it with shame, for it forced her out of her homeland

00:01:46.369 --> 00:01:52.209
Across many kingdoms the appearance of this curse and those who bear it has been met with fear and hatred

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:59.199
The king of Iron bound the Undead in chains and tortured them endlessly. The current king of light did much the same

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:01.369
Sending them to an inescapable Bastille

00:02:01.369 --> 00:02:06.519
It is not so strange to think that the land of Mirrah would have reacted in much the same Manner

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:10.630
damning Lucatiel if it was ever discovered what she had become

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.750
Have you heard of the undead?

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:17.800
These poor souls affected by the curse

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:24.999
An undead gradually loses his humanity until his wits degrade completely

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:34.299
Finally he turns hollow and preys upon others. And a hollow can never be human again

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:41.350
One can skirt this wicked fate only with the help of the souls found here

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:46.329
assuming of course that the legends are true

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.660
I can only hope...

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.780
...that they are

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.320
the mask hides Lucatiel's shame

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:59.680
It is said that Drangleic holds the souls that can cure the curse

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:05.660
Many Adventurers rose to the call: some driven by greed, others by desperation.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:09.480
For Lucatiel Drangleic holds Salvation

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.720
I found my thoughts growing hazy

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.020
My memories are fading, oldest first

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:24.680
The curse is doing its work upon me. I am frightened

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.880
Terribly so. If everything should fade...

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.290
...what will be left of me?

00:03:35.069 --> 00:03:40.009
Existential despair. The curse took her knighthood, the thing she devoted her life to

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:45.829
Lucatiel's self was based on her prowess as a knight and her loyalty to her lord

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.280
Forced to leave Drangleic. What does she have left?

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:55.220
She will lose herself given time. She will lose that which made her what she is

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:56.820
Oh.....

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.120
You.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:06.640
My thoughts... are very... scatttered

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.280
What is this curse?

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:17.880
The question rings in my mind, but I haven't the focus to answer it

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.599
Loss frightens me no end

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.290
Loss of memory. Loss of self

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:30.780
If I were told that by killing you I would be freed of this curse

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.820
Then I would draw my sword without hesitation

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.859
I don't want to die. I want to exist

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.920
I would sacrifice anything

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.560
Anything at all for this

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.700
It shames me, but it is the truth

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:59.369
Sometimes I feel obsessed with this insignificant thing called self

00:05:01.229 --> 00:05:04.279
Even so I am compelled to preserve it

00:05:05.639 --> 00:05:07.788
Am I wrong to feel so?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.780
Surely you do the same in my shoes

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.440
Maybe we're all cursed

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.620
In the moment we're born

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:29.210
All of us face the same despair: Cursed or not there is no meaning in the world beyond what meaning we give it

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:37.099
Despite this we seek meaning, for a life free of purpose simply means that we are able to imprint our own

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:41.389
We are all a product of our past and this shapes our future

00:05:41.969 --> 00:05:47.929
But an undead is doomed to lose his past and thus fated to be robbed of his future

00:05:48.719 --> 00:05:53.269
Lucatiel has one hope: to find her past and recover who she was

00:05:54.199 --> 00:05:56.199
I had an older brother

00:05:56.939 --> 00:05:58.939
We learned to fence together

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:04.660
He became the most decorated swordsman in all of Mirrah

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:13.380
I never even compared to him. In fact, I never beat him. Not once

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.780
Then, one day

00:06:17.699 --> 00:06:19.699
He was gone

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.860
Lost without a trace

00:06:22.919 --> 00:06:27.739
Now I'm certain that he was taken by the curse

00:06:29.339 --> 00:06:31.999
if only someone would hear my tale

00:06:33.479 --> 00:06:36.258
My brother must have come here, too

00:06:37.949 --> 00:06:40.579
Soon I may forget even about him

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:46.969
An undead gradually loses his humanity until his wits degrade completely

00:06:47.699 --> 00:06:50.688
Finally he turns hollow and preys upon others

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.960
You...

00:06:53.969 --> 00:06:55.969
What's become of you?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.960
my dear brother

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.980
I won't die in this foul place

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.060
You...

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.260
Who are you?

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.240
Oh... no

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.820
Forgive me. I know you

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.560
Yes, of course

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.720
How goes your journey?

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:38.070
We find Lucatiel here after her help in countless battles and right before her finding her brother

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:41.400
It is assumed that they have fought, but it is not known

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.920
Perhaps she never met him

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:50.060
Perhaps It's better that way, for he has lost himself and attacks others to Rob them of their humanity

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:57.340
Regardless, Lucatiel never progresses further so it is here, outside of Aldia's keep that her journey ends

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.500
I know not what you seek in this faraway land

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.980
But I pray for your safety

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:09.059
My name is Lucatiel

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.480
I beg of you, remember my name

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.110
for I may not myself

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:25.650
Existential Despair is a universal human condition. There is no meaning in the world, and yet we seek it... insatiably

